## Program Learning Outcomes

Students completing this program will be able to:

- Demonstrate advanced knowledge of systematic and biblical theology.
- Conduct scholarly biblical and theological research.
- Evaluate theological perspectives through biblical interpretation.
- Examine Pentecostal–Charismatic theology and historical development.
- Analyze the doctrine and ministry of the Holy Spirit.
- Demonstrate academic writing and theological research skills.
- Apply theological scholarship to Christian education and ministry.
